			(property "ki_description" "USB PD sink controller, ESSOP-10. Asks the charger for 20 V (CFG1 120k to GND, CFG2/CFG3 have internal pull-ups). VHV takes VBUS directly. PG is open-drain, low when the request was granted. Replaces the plug-in trigger board. Pinout from the WCH CH224 datasheet v2.0 Table 4-1."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					) hide
